
flow:

Raw Data → Data Cleaning → Annotation/Labeling → Quality Assurance → Dataset → Model Training → Evaluation → Human Feedback → Production


| Topic                 | What to learn                                            |
| --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |
| Annotation guidelines | How to convert business requirements into labeling rules |
| Label taxonomy        | Classes, categories, attributes                          |
| Bounding boxes        | Object detection                                         |
| Segmentation          | Pixel-level/object-level labeling                        |
| Classification        | Assigning categories                                     |
| Entity extraction     | Person, organization, location, product, etc.            |
| Sentiment             | Positive/negative/neutral                                |
| Intent                | User request classification                              |
| Transcription         | Audio → text                                             |
| Speaker diarization   | Who spoke when                                           |
| Text ranking          | Compare responses                                        |
| Image annotation      | Objects, scenes, attributes                              |
| Video annotation      | Objects + tracking + actions                             |
| LLM evaluation        | Evaluate AI-generated answers                            |
